# "Counter target noncreature spell": on turn two Bot2 casts an Ornithopter, a creature spell, which the ability cannot
# target (the refusal), then a Lightning Bolt, which it can: the Guardian's counter is removed to counter it (the positive
# control) and Bot2 draws. With no counter left the cost cannot be paid, so the second Bolt is not answerable (the refusal),
# though Bot1 has the {1}{U} untapped in a Mox Sapphire and a Mox Ruby.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Glen Elendra Guardian
Mox Jet
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

